-   466→
-   467→          → The two-step confirm: the Confirm Disposal button is disabled until titleInput.trim() === entry.title.trim(). This is the
-   468→              same pattern GitHub uses for repo deletion.
-   469→
-   470→          → The audit entry is severity = Critical (disposal is irreversible) — retention_reject is severity = Info (snooze is reversible).
-   471→
-   472→          → The race-safe updateMany pattern: if you open two browser tabs and click Approve on the same doc in both, only
-   473→              one succeeds — the other gets 409 "concurrent_modification".
