-   816→          The Users screen is Registrar-only. Create users (no password at creation — a set-password email is
-   817→          sent), edit roles, disable, enable, reset 2FA, reset password. Three protection mechanisms work
-   818→          independently: lockout (3 failed attempts), disabled (admin toggle), and 2FA reset (clears the secret).
-   819→          The last-Registrar protection prevents you from disabling or role-changing the only remaining active
-   820→          Registrar — system-wide count, not self-check.
