-   835→              user.
-   836→
-   837→          → Last-Registrar protection is a SYSTEM-WIDE count of OTHER active Registrars — not a self-check. So you can't disable
-   838→              yourself if you're the only one, but you CAN if there are 2+ active Registrars.
-   839→
