-    55→
-    56→- `src/app/api/dashboard/stats/route.ts:42-50` — the `db.document.count` call with no `where` filter (other than Officer scoping)
-    57→- `src/app/api/dashboard/document-types/route.ts:22-30` — the `db.document.findMany` with `where: { disposedAt: null }`
-    58→- `src/components/app/views/dashboard.tsx:251` — the StatCard showing `stats.totalDocuments` (23)
-    59→- `src/components/app/views/dashboard.tsx:323` — the subtitle showing `docTypesData?.total` (21)
